        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005002,
            "content": "Woke up, and everything was in a different place! Felt like I'd taken a train ride.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005003
          },
          {
            "id": 72005003,
            "content": "Thanks, train driver. But this one's made of wood. So I guess... a wood train?",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005004
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091039,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -9064,
          17552
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005102,
            "content": "Everyone has their own room.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005103
          },
          {
            "id": 72005103,
            "content": "I want my own room too. Right here!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005104
          },
          {
            "id": 72005104,
            "content": "Welcome to my place. Next up, I'm gonna get some furniture!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005105
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091040,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -12266,
          15492
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005202,
            "content": "A slide! This is the best slide ever.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005203
          },
          {
            "id": 72005203,
            "content": "People keep flattening my slide, but that's okay.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005204
          },
          {
            "id": 72005204,
            "content": "I can just ice-skate on these flat crates instead!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005205
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091041,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -19590,
          11386
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005302,
            "content": "All the iron boxes here look the same.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005303
          },
          {
            "id": 72005303,
            "content": "How do they tell their brothers and sisters apart?",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005304
          },
          {
            "id": 72005304,
            "content": "No need to tell them apart? No, that can't be right. Without family, you'd be lonely.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005305
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091042,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -12930,
          368
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005602,
            "content": "The guards are patrolling.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005603
          },
          {
            "id": 72005603,
            "content": "But they can't see what's behind them.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005604
          },
          {
            "id": 72005604,
            "content": "I patrol too — going the opposite way.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005605
          },
          {
            "id": 72005605,
            "content": "That way, no bad guys can get close. Perfect!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005606
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091043,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -13386,
          7056
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005702,
            "content": "A vehicle that follows a fixed path is a train.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005703
          },
          {
            "id": 72005703,
            "content": "A Paniemon that follows a fixed path is a Trainiemon.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005704
          },
          {
            "id": 72005704,
            "content": "What do you think? I really like this name!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005705
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7091044,
        "srId": 106301,
        "pos": [
          -16072,
          13405
        ],
        "dialogues": [
          {
            "id": 72005802,
            "content": "Trains are so silly. They need a track in front to lead them across a bridge.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005803
          },
          {
            "id": 72005803,
            "content": "So I'll show them — just jump like me! Problem solved!",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005804
          },
          {
            "id": 72005804,
            "content": "If they can't jump... that's their problem. They're always running, so they should be light on their feet.",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005805
          },
          {
            "id": 72005805,
            "content": "What's wrong with them?",
            "npc": 820000,
            "next": 72005806
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
